    note for Settings "One JSON document in the app_settings key-value row.<br/>Every field has a serde default, so documents written by older<br/>versions keep loading. sanitize() runs on load and on every save.<br/>version drives one-time migrations; CURRENT_VERSION is 4."

    note for TtsSettings "12 fields, 3 of them legacy. voiceEn, voiceAr and voiceDe are<br/>serialised so a pre-v4 settings blob still deserialises; the v4 migration<br/>copies them into LanguageEntry.tts_voice and nothing reads them again.<br/>src/app/types.ts does not declare them: TS type and Rust type disagree."

    note for GeneralSettings "21 fields. windowPosition is a locked preset unless it is<br/>custom: bottom-right, bottom-left or center is recomputed from the<br/>monitor work area on every show, resize, compact toggle and restore."

