    note for Db "std::sync::Mutex around a single rusqlite::Connection.<br/>No pool: SQLite access here is short and serialised, and<br/>Connection is not Sync. Poison-tolerant lock.<br/>Schema: conversations, messages plus FTS5, kv, mcp_servers,<br/>mcp_tool_permissions, dictation_history, attachments."

    note for Message "role is one of: user, assistant, tool, assistant_tool_calls.<br/>assistant_tool_calls carries tool_calls; each tool row carries tool_call_id.<br/>build_history drops an exchange whose results are missing, so a<br/>cancelled turn never poisons the next prompt."

