    note for CatalogEntry "download_bytes is the sum of RemoteFile.size_bytes. The SHA-256<br/>digest and the pinned release URL come from the catalogue, so nothing<br/>is fetched until the user clicks Download. The built-in voice is<br/>supertonic-3-int8, 123 MB, 31 languages; built-in STT is whisper-small."

    note for GpuStatus "The GPU pack is a directory of CUDA libraries, not a model.<br/>active stays false until the app has been relaunched from gpu/launcher,<br/>at which point restart_required flips to false."

    note for MemoryItem "key is stt, voice:en, voice:ar, voice:de or llm:model-id.<br/>state is loaded, loading, idle, missing or failed. detail carries the<br/>real device (GPU or CPU) from services::gpu::is_active, which is the<br/>value VoiceCapability.acceleration hardcodes to cpu instead."

