    note for ChatEvent "8 variants, delivered over Channel ChatEvent. Every variant<br/>carries turn_id, and the store ignores events whose turn_id is not the<br/>current turn, so a late event from a stopped turn cannot corrupt the<br/>visible conversation. Delta and Reasoning are batched at 50 ms on arrival."

    note for VoiceEvent "5 variants, delivered on the voice://event global event. State<br/>carries a session number, so the idle of an older session cannot end a<br/>newer one in the UI. Level carries a 24-band spectrum at about 20 Hz."

    note for TtsEvent "7 variants, delivered on the tts://event global event. Sentence<br/>carries the text and its duration so SpokenText can highlight each word in<br/>step; it is emitted by the tts-progress thread when playback actually<br/>starts, not when the clip is queued for synthesis."

    note for DictationStateEvent "9 states, delivered on dictation://state to the overlay window<br/>only. Carries an optional result with raw, inserted, corrected and<br/>correctionError."

