    note for AppError "16 variants. code() returns the stable wire string: lmstudio_unavailable,<br/>lmstudio_error, no_model, timeout, database, stt_unavailable,<br/>tts_unavailable, audio, mcp, permission_denied, download, not_found,<br/>invalid, io, cancelled, other. Serialised as { code, detail } and NOT as the<br/>Diagnostic problem-cause-fix shape that AGENTS.md section 3 mandates."

    note for VoiceCapability "DRIFT: acceleration is hardcoded to the string cpu, while<br/>commands/memory.rs computes the real device from services::gpu::is_active.<br/>The two disagree on the same machine."

